"{    \"translations\": [        {            \"english_version\": \"Germany's AfD party is celebrating a big win, getting 44% of the vote, which is much more than the conservatives who got 17%.\",            \"english_title\": \"AfD Party Wins Big\",            \"translated_version\": \"El partido AfD de Alemania est\u00e1 celebrando una gran victoria, obteniendo 44% de los votos, que es mucho m\u00e1s que los conservadores que obtuvieron 17%.\",            \"translated_title\": \"Partido AfD Gana Grande\"        },        {            \"english_version\": \"Despite talks between US envoys and both Putin and Zelensky, people in Kyiv think the fighting will keep going, according to James Landale.\",            \"english_title\": \"Kyiv Expects More Fighting\",            \"translated_version\": \"A pesar de las conversaciones entre enviados de EE.UU. y Putin y Zelensky, la gente en Kyiv piensa que la lucha seguir\u00e1, seg\u00fan James Landale.\",            \"translated_title\": \"Kyiv Espera M\u00e1s Lucha\"        },        {            \"english_version\": \"A Boeing plane caught fire after it left the runway at a speed of almost 130 mph.\",            \"english_title\": \"Boeing Plane Catches Fire\",            \"translated_version\": \"Un avi\u00f3n Boeing se incendi\u00f3 despu\u00e9s de salir de la pista a una velocidad de casi 130 mph.\",            \"translated_title\": \"Avi\u00f3n Boeing Se Incendia\"        },        {            \"english_version\": \"More than 170,000 airline passengers are stuck because ash was found in the air near Jakarta after eruptions.\",            \"english_title\": \"Passengers Stuck Due to Ash\",            \"translated_version\": \"M\u00e1s de 170,000 pasajeros de aerol\u00edneas est\u00e1n atrapados porque se encontr\u00f3 ceniza en el aire cerca de Yakarta despu\u00e9s de erupciones.\",            \"translated_title\": \"Pasajeros Atrapados por Ceniza\"        },        {            \"english_version\": \"The Prince of Wales will attend the funeral of Harald V in Oslo next week on behalf of the King.\",            \"english_title\": \"Prince to Attend Funeral\",            \"translated_version\": \"El Pr\u00edncipe de Gales asistir\u00e1 al funeral de Harald V en Oslo la pr\u00f3xima semana en nombre del Rey.\",            \"translated_title\": \"Pr\u00edncipe Asistir\u00e1 al Funeral\"        }    ]}"